  "summary": "test_packaging.py falls back to tomli on Python 3.10, and a scan over every tracked Python file replaces the fixed three-module guard.",
  "why": "OVR-000479 added tests/contract_compiler/test_packaging.py with an unguarded import tomllib. Python 3.10 has no stdlib tomllib; main CI failed on 3.10 from 2026-09-22 and the v0.15.0 release run failed its 3.10 leg, so nothing was published. The 0.14.0 guard in test_ci.py named three modules and could not see a new file. The new test scans every tracked .py file and was RED on test_packaging.py:33 before the fix.",
